e=\"67-df-prim-provability\">67-df-prim-provability</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本轮核对形式陈述、类型、变量绑定和册内依赖；未重新核验原书 PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"input_verification_status","html":"local-definition-checked"},{"key":"input_source_proof_status","html":"陈述及下述本地推导已复核；未作机器证明"},{"key":"revision_status","html":"locally-revised"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"renamed_from","html":"67-df-feferman-complete"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span> 使用固定有效算术呈示，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_T\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6a4c234306a0ec0c\" href=\"?note=6a4c234306a0ec0c\" title=\"67-df-provability-predicate\">67-df-provability-predicate</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 为自然编号，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar n\">\\(\\bar n\\)</span> 为数词。</li>\n<li>句子与可推导性见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"854772391cef4007\" href=\"?note=854772391cef4007\" title=\"67-df-sentence\">67-df-sentence</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"573b4c635ea6d91f\" href=\"?note=573b4c635ea6d91f\" title=\"67-df-prim-provability\">67-df-prim-provability</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProvRuleEq}\">\\(\\mathrm{ProvRuleEq}\\)</span> 是下式定义的两向可证性规则等价谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProvRuleEq}(T)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\\n\\bigl((T\\vdash\\varphi)\\Longleftrightarrow(T\\vdash\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\overline{g(\\varphi)}))\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ProvRuleEq}(T)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\\n\\bigl((T\\vdash\\varphi)\\Longleftrightarrow(T\\vdash\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\overline{g(\\varphi)}))\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留原公式的两向元语言可证对应，只按内容修正文件名和谓词名，不将它称为 Feferman 完备性。它不是内部全反思模式。已有的 provability-correctness 条目不改名、不删改；充分条件见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"9a69c2c80263c834\" href=\"?note=9a69c2c80263c834\" title=\"67-thm-sigma1-sound-provability-rule-equivalence\">67-thm-sigma1-sound-provability-rule-equivalence</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"854772391cef4007","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"6a4c234306a0ec0c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-provability-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-prim-provability","status":"resolved","id":"573b4c635ea6d91f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-prim-provability]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"6a4c234306a0ec0c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}$ 使用固定有效算术呈示，$\\mathrm{Prov}_T$ 见 [[67-df-provability-predicate]]；$g$ 为自然编号，$\\bar n$ 为数词。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"854772391cef4007","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excer